---
import LiveDemoCanvas from '../LiveDemoCanvas.astro';
---
<section class="composition-demo not-content" data-bridge-composition>
  <LiveDemoCanvas size="tall" label="Score and Audio playback composition">
    <div class="composition-demo__body">
      <div class="composition-demo__actions">
        <button type="button" data-load>Load example</button>
        <button type="button" data-replace disabled>Replace source</button>
        <button type="button" data-attach disabled>Attach Score views</button>
        <button type="button" data-dispose disabled>Dispose session</button>
      </div>
      <output role="status" data-status>Load an example to enable audio and prepare a matched score and recording.</output>
      <div data-transport></div>
      <div class="composition-demo__actions">
        <label>Rate
          <select data-rate disabled>
            <option value="0.5">0.5×</option>
            <option value="1" selected>1×</option>
            <option value="2">2×</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label><input type="checkbox" data-loop disabled /> Repeat the group</label>
      </div>
      <output data-position>No active session</output>
      <p>The opening of the public Arabesque No. 1 MIDI is rendered as audio. Replace source switches between excerpts of 16 and 24 quarter-note beats. Score views borrow the muted score player's data and current state.</p>
      <div data-wave-surface role="img" aria-label="Rendered backing track and its playback position"></div>
      <div data-playback-owner hidden></div>
      <div class="composition-demo__views" data-score-views></div>
      <details>
        <summary>Recent completed commands</summary>
        <pre data-events aria-label="Last six command results">No commands yet.</pre>
      </details>
    </div>
  </LiveDemoCanvas>
</section>
<script>
  import {mountDemos} from '../demo-lifecycle';
  import {mountBridgeComposition} from './bridge-composition-client';
  mountDemos('[data-bridge-composition]', mountBridgeComposition);
</script>
<style>
  .composition-demo__body { width: 100%; min-width: 0; padding: 0.8rem; }
  .composition-demo__actions { display: flex; gap: 0.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; margin: 0.7rem 0; }
  .composition-demo__actions button, .composition-demo__actions select { font: inherit; padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem; }
  .composition-demo__actions label { display: inline-flex; gap: 0.4rem; align-items: center; }
  .composition-demo__actions :focus-visible { outline: 2px solid currentColor; outline-offset: 2px; }
  .composition-demo__body output { display: block; margin: 0.5rem 0; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .composition-demo__body p { font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .composition-demo__body details { margin-top: 0.8rem; }
  .composition-demo__body pre { overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre; font-size: 0.75rem; }
  .composition-demo__views { min-width: 0; overflow-x: auto; }
  .composition-demo__views :global(score-view), .composition-demo__views :global(score-chord-analysis) { margin-top: 0.7rem; }
</style>
